WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
Our next section will focus on bodily injuries.

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.320
While our last section dealt specifically with blood loss,

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:10.320
here we are going to explore how to identify and treat a variety of other

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:13.680
physical traumas that can happen to the body. As we

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.480
discuss these, keep in mind that the severity of these

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:20.719
injuries can vary quite a bit. Some might need 911 right away, while

00:00:20.719 --> 00:00:25.360
others you may be able to treat safely on site.

